  "description": "<p>Do you want to study at a university that was named one of the nationâ€™s best universities by the US News &amp; World Report?</p><p>Sacred Heart University is a private Roman Catholic university that celebrates all faiths across its expansive campus.</p><p>The university was rated as having one of the best undergraduate business schools in 2024 according to the Princeton Review, with business as one of the top courses at the university.</p><p>Sacred Heart University was ranked as one of the fastest-growing private doctoral institutions by the Chronicle of Higher Education as the institution invests a lot in its teaching and facilities.</p><p><strong>The most popular courses at Sacred Heart University are:</strong></p><ul><li>Finance and Business Economics</li><li>Exercise Science</li><li>Nursing</li><li>Marketing</li><li>Psychology</li></ul><p>Are you feeling apprehensive about the transition to a new country and navigating through its academic landscape? Do you question if the university you have chosen offers support and resources tailored for students from varied cultural backgrounds? Moreover, are you eager to learn if graduating from this institution could potentially enhance your opportunities for securing employment globally?</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Discover why Sacred Heart University might just be the place for you!</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/courses/?institutions=%5B%22Sacred+Heart+University%22%5D&amp;fromInstitution=true&amp;locations=%5B%7B%22key%22%3A%22United+States%22%2C%22values%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D\">View courses now</a></p>  <p>Sacred Heart University is a higher-education establishment located in Fairfield, Connecticut, just 55 miles north of New York City. The campus was founded in 1963 with just 200 students. Today, the university runs various program-based courses at undergraduate, graduate and doctorate levels for around 9,000 students.</p><p>In recent years, the university has received awards and acknowledgements as a happy and positive place to study. Sacred Heart was named one of the top colleges in America by Forbes and College Magazine ranked its campus in the top 10 on the East Coast.</p><p>With over 80 courses on offer across six different colleges, students have plenty of choices at varying levels at Sacred Heart.</p><p>Many modern facilities are available at Sacred Heart University, particularly in the West Campus Center of Innovation. Here, state-of-the-art labs are located to provide students with access to high-level equipment.</p><p>Among the current facilities, you will find laboratories dedicated to robotics and computing, artificial intelligence and cybersecurity on the West Campus.</p><p><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/articles/reasons-to-choose-sacred-heart-university/\">Reasons to choose Sacred Heart University</a></p> <p><strong>Why Sacred Heart University?</strong></p><ul><li>100% of students in the class of 2022 are successfully employed or attending graduate school</li><li>There are 56,822 living Sacred Heart University alumni</li><li>16:1 student-to-faculty ratio</li></ul><p>Sacred Heart University provides a 99.4% overall placement rate. Embrace the opportunity to join the ranks of graduates from a globally renowned institution, paving your way towards a future filled with success, substantial income, and joy.</p><p>Turn your aspirations into achievements today.</p><p>Become part of the global community of students who have found their path to the future at Sacred Heart University.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/courses/?institutions=%5B%22Sacred+Heart+University%22%5D&amp;fromInstitution=true&amp;locations=%5B%7B%22key%22%3A%22United+States%22%2C%22values%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D\">Browse courses easily today!</a></p><p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> <p>Whilst living on campus, students can socialise and engage with like-minded peers. Sacred Heart encourages learning and discussion to continue outside of lectures and seminars, and this often occurs in halls and informal locations.</p><p>Also, with eh SHUcard, you can move freely around the campus. The card allows you to enter other buildings and meet friends in alternative halls of residence.</p><p><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/articles/student-life-at-sacred-heart-university/\">Student life at Sacred Heart University</a></p>",
